{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1213894-which-styles-in-the-sidereal-book","id":1213894,"title":"Which Styles in the Sidereal book?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-01T14:41:04-07:00","id":1213894,"title":"Which Styles in the Sidereal book?","content":"Their native Charmset is probably going to be larger than before, but probably not by much.* That leaves room for more than the eight Styles the Dragon-Blooded got, not counting any Styles that might be included in the Sidereal supplement. <br /> <br /> * Not unless Astrology is going to be expressed as Charms like the Astrological Charms. Some of which, if I remember the complaints right, are better off as sorcerous workings because of how seldom you\u2019d even use them. And because they were all gated off by default anyway. <br /> <br /> In the Sidereal book itself:<br /> <br /> * Throne Shadow<br /> * Crystal Chameleon<br /> * Violet Bier of Sorrows<br /> * Possibly the other four Maiden Styles<br /> * Seven Drunken Gods, if it isn\u2019t in Lunars<br /> <br /> * Citrine Poxes<br /> * Prismatic Arrangment<br /> * Charcoal Marches<br /> * Sapphire Veils<br /> <br /> The supplement might have:<br /> <br /> * The Four Arguments of Virtue Styles practiced in heaven by the gods<br /> * Another Sidereal Style<br /> <br /> <br /> The Getimian book is another source for whatever Sidereal Arts aren\u2019t included in those books. <br /> <br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T14:55:16-07:00","id":1213901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1213894-which-styles-in-the-sidereal-book#post1213894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Throne Shadow<br /> * Crystal Chameleon<br /> * The Four Arguments of Virtue Styles practiced in heaven by the gods</div> </div> </div> </div>Weren't these &quot;just&quot; celestial styles of MA by the previous classification?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1213894-which-styles-in-the-sidereal-book#post1213894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Violet Bier of Sorrows<br /> * Possibly the other four Maiden Styles</div> </div> </div> </div>Wouldn't Scarlet-Patterned Battlefield Style and Sapphire Veils of Passion maybe count as Battles and Serenity styles respectively?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1213894-which-styles-in-the-sidereal-book#post1213894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Seven Drunken Gods, if it isn\u2019t in Lunars</div> </div> </div> </div>That one is utterly new for me, never heard of it before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T14:56:47-07:00","id":1213902,"title":"","content":"Vance ruled out official other-four-Maiden styles a while ago when i asked. They donMt canonically not-exist, but he wasn\u2019t planning on making them an official thing either.<br /> <br /> I know Lea has pushed for every new crop of Martial Arts styles to include at least ONE non-esoteric animal style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T15:02:47-07:00","id":1213906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1213894-which-styles-in-the-sidereal-book?p=1213902#post1213902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vance ruled out official other-four-Maiden styles a while ago when i asked. They donMt canonically not-exist, but he wasn\u2019t planning on making them an official thing either.<br /> <br /> I know Lea has pushed for every new crop of Martial Arts styles to include at least ONE non-esoteric animal style.</div> </div> </div> </div>What i think is good - animal styles are a classic staple of martial arts, so the more ground covered in that area, the better i guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T15:46:06-07:00","id":1213931,"title":"","content":"I've asked Vance before about what SMA styles will be coming back and these are the five that he has short listed:<ul><li>Prismatic Arrangement of Creation Style</li> <li>Citrine Poxes of Contagion Style</li> <li>Charcoal March of Spiders Style</li> <li>Borders of Kaleidoscopic Logic Style</li> <li>Obsidian Shards of Infinity Style</li> </ul><br /> The fist three have been in since 1e, and the last two he really likes. You can see where he said this in the AtD thread <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069023-ask-the-devs?p=1088967#post1088967\">here</a>. Personally though, that's all I'd really hope for. Sapphire Veils doesn't seem cool thematically, Quicksilver Hands looks difficult to convert, and Scarlet Patterned is nice and would seem thematically appropriate as follow up to White Reaper, but I don't see any real loss if we never see it again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T16:44:51-07:00","id":1213960,"title":"","content":"I would hope its mostly SMAs since its very rare status means its of little use to anyone but sidereal exalted and getimians so that is the best book to stick them in. Even solars have trouble learning them and need to manage to get a sidereal (or maybe getimian?) to be their sifu if they want it. Let other books handle the styles <i>everyone</i> can use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T16:51:14-07:00","id":1213965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nilihum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1213894-which-styles-in-the-sidereal-book?p=1213931#post1213931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've asked Vance before about what SMA styles will be coming back and these are the five that he has short listed:<ul><li>Prismatic Arrangement of Creation Style</li> <li>Citrine Poxes of Contagion Style</li> <li>Charcoal March of Spiders Style</li> <li>Borders of Kaleidoscopic Logic Style</li> <li>Obsidian Shards of Infinity Style</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nilihum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1213894-which-styles-in-the-sidereal-book?p=1213931#post1213931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><ul><li>Obsidian Shards of Infinity Style</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Praise the Sun!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T17:52:15-07:00","id":1213983,"title":"","content":"5 Sidereal Styles, and 3 normal Styles (Violet Bier, Thrown Shadow, and an Animal style) would be eight Styles, matching the number in WFHW.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}